WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:04.810
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

00:04.810 --> 00:12.530
Asano hitogomi o nagamete coffee nondeiru
Watching a crowd in the morning, and drinking coffee

00:13.450 --> 00:21.450
Aseri nado naikano youni hitoni wa mieru daro
People must see me as if I don't have any worries

00:22.080 --> 00:29.920
lma menomae ni atomodori dekinai jikan ga
I know that the time I will never be able to get back

00:30.710 --> 00:38.220
Tashika ni nagareteru koto o watashi wa shitteru
Is moving in front of me

00:38.430 --> 00:47.440
Marude kyou shika nai toiu ikikata o shitemita toki
If I live like today is the last day of my life

00:47.730 --> 00:55.490
Saisho ni nani ga mieru darou
I wonder what I can see first

00:56.570 --> 01:00.780
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:01.240 --> 01:09.250
Sore ga donnani chiisana hikari demo ii
I don't care no matter how small the light is

01:09.750 --> 01:11.750
Sugata o misete hoshii
I just wish to see its shape

01:11.750 --> 01:15.970
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:16.680 --> 01:22.430
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.430 --> 01:22.640
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.640 --> 01:29.150
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
Sonna hito ni deaitai
Who I can tell my honest feelings to

01:29.150 --> 01:30.980
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology

01:39.700 --> 01:40.860
Visit a grave?

01:41.400 --> 01:44.030
Yeah, though I don't know
if it's still there.

01:44.540 --> 01:45.470
Whose?

01:45.640 --> 01:46.570
Someone I knew.

01:48.040 --> 01:49.180
Police Station

01:49.180 --> 01:49.880
Police Station
Misaki Village?

01:49.880 --> 01:50.870
Misaki Village?

01:51.180 --> 01:53.710
There's no village
around here now.

01:54.420 --> 01:56.010
Oh, maybe this is it.

01:56.220 --> 01:59.950
See the condo on that hill?
There's a graveyard right below it.

02:00.660 --> 02:03.150
That's the only one that remains
since before the war.

02:13.610 --> 02:18.110
Episode 10
Promised Tomorrow
(Part I)

02:23.250 --> 02:26.040
The only thing that remains
unchanged is those loud birds.

02:27.080 --> 02:28.480
No surprise there, I guess.

02:29.320 --> 02:31.120
It's been 60 years already.

02:31.130 --> 02:31.790
Kogure Family Grave

02:43.430 --> 02:45.090
<i>Take me along...</i>

02:45.570 --> 02:47.060
<i>when you go looking</i>
<i>for a mermaid.</i>

02:47.800 --> 02:49.770
<i>Promise me, Yuta.</i>

02:57.050 --> 02:58.210
Whose grave is it?

02:59.780 --> 03:02.380
A woman named Nae.

03:03.220 --> 03:04.080
A woman?

03:04.650 --> 03:08.610
I lived here for
a short while in the past.

03:09.460 --> 03:12.450
She was always kind to me then.

03:13.660 --> 03:16.530
<i>Take me away with you.</i>
<i>Promise me.</i>

03:17.530 --> 03:20.530
She was a warm-hearted,
sweet woman.

03:22.890 --> 03:23.710
Kogure Family Grave
Ota Family Grave

03:23.710 --> 03:25.470
Kogure Family Grave
Ota Family Grave
Must be a boring story for you.

03:25.470 --> 03:26.140
Kogure Family Grave
Ota Family Grave

03:26.140 --> 03:27.180
Kogure Family Grave
Ota Family Grave
I don't like it.

03:27.180 --> 03:29.810
Kogure Family Grave
Ota Family Grave

03:29.810 --> 03:30.680
Kogure Family Grave
Ota Family Grave
Hey, Mana.

03:31.210 --> 03:32.310
I'm going for a short walk.

03:33.750 --> 03:35.410
Don't go too far.

03:53.440 --> 03:55.140
How dare you cause me
so much trouble?

03:55.140 --> 03:56.330
You bitch!

03:56.810 --> 03:58.800
If you try to run away again,
I'll kill you!

04:02.480 --> 04:03.170
Stop it!

04:05.010 --> 04:06.240
Who the hell are you?

04:06.420 --> 04:07.440
Get lost!

04:28.500 --> 04:29.600
Are you all right?

04:30.040 --> 04:32.560
Yeah.
But this guy...

04:39.110 --> 04:39.910
Miss!

04:56.030 --> 04:58.000
Mana! Mana!

04:58.530 --> 05:01.760
Where did she wander off to?

05:06.980 --> 05:08.770
Go straight to the other world.

05:10.450 --> 05:13.110
It's your fault.
You shouldn't have been there.

05:24.330 --> 05:27.430
Nae, I will continue to protect you...

05:27.430 --> 05:31.230
to the end of time by using
any means necessary.

05:32.030 --> 05:36.270
Please don't go outside again...

05:37.170 --> 05:38.070
Nae.

05:43.480 --> 05:45.540
Mana! Mana!

05:48.150 --> 05:49.620
Where on earth has she gone?

05:49.750 --> 05:50.450
Hey!

05:51.490 --> 05:53.390
What are you doing here?

05:53.890 --> 05:55.860
I'm not looking for trouble.

05:57.160 --> 05:59.090
Are you Yuta?

06:02.900 --> 06:05.420
<i>They say you're looking</i>
<i>for a mermaid.</i>

06:09.040 --> 06:10.830
<i>What are you going to do</i>
<i>when you find one?</i>

06:10.970 --> 06:13.440
<i>You want to live long that badly?</i>

06:14.610 --> 06:15.580
<i>The opposite.</i>

06:20.850 --> 06:23.020
<i>You ate mermaid flesh?</i>

06:23.020 --> 06:23.950
<i>Really?</i>

06:24.590 --> 06:25.420
<i>Yeah.</i>

06:25.690 --> 06:28.120
<i>That's why I want to</i>
<i>find a mermaid...</i>

06:28.120 --> 06:29.520
<i>and go back to normal.</i>

06:29.990 --> 06:31.550
<i>I know it's hard to believe.</i>

06:31.930 --> 06:33.260
<i>Oh, I do believe you.</i>

06:34.500 --> 06:37.060
<i>I know some things</i>
<i>about mermaids myself.</i>

06:38.370 --> 06:40.030
<i>But I'm not telling you now.</i>

06:40.640 --> 06:41.530
<i>You know what?</i>

06:41.970 --> 06:44.670
<i>I'll send Sokichi here for you</i>
<i>when I'm ready.</i>

06:45.470 --> 06:47.070
<i>He's an errand boy</i>
<i>who works for my family.</i>

06:47.410 --> 06:49.070
<i>He's a good boy who knows</i>
<i>how to keep his mouth shut.</i>

06:50.850 --> 06:53.610
You're the boy from back then.

06:54.050 --> 06:55.450
You've grown so old.

06:55.750 --> 06:58.240
I have to make sure.

06:58.720 --> 07:02.280
If you really are the Yuta
from that time.

07:02.820 --> 07:03.850
Wait a second.

07:04.060 --> 07:05.290
No need to get violent.

07:07.260 --> 07:08.390
Cut yourself.

07:09.160 --> 07:10.400
You got to be kidding.

07:10.400 --> 07:11.560
Why would I do that?

07:11.970 --> 07:12.900
Please.

07:15.340 --> 07:16.500
I'm not a show monkey.

07:18.370 --> 07:19.310
There.

07:21.510 --> 07:22.640
It's healed.

07:23.350 --> 07:24.610
You're for real.

07:24.910 --> 07:25.970
Of course I am.

07:26.650 --> 07:27.440
Yuta.

07:27.920 --> 07:29.650
I have to ask you this now.

07:29.790 --> 07:35.620
Is it really true that you didn't take
Miss Nae away 60 years ago?

07:37.260 --> 07:38.590
<i>Take me away with you.</i>

07:39.590 --> 07:40.620
<i>Promise me.</i>

07:42.200 --> 07:45.000
<i>No. I can't take you</i>
<i>with me, Nae.</i>

07:45.530 --> 07:48.260
<i>I'm not a normal man.</i>

07:48.970 --> 07:50.630
<i>Besides, you have...</i>

07:50.740 --> 07:52.330
<i>Nae. Nae.</i>

07:52.870 --> 07:53.810
<i>Sokichi.</i>

07:54.510 --> 07:55.870
<i>Has Nae gone out?</i>

07:56.510 --> 07:57.410
<i>I don't know.</i>

07:58.580 --> 08:00.380
<i>Where can she be?</i>

08:01.220 --> 08:03.450
<i>I've come all the way back</i>
<i>using my rare days off.</i>

08:04.020 --> 08:06.110
<i>You have such a fine fiancé.</i>

08:06.820 --> 08:08.720
<i>He's a brilliant student</i>
<i>at Imperial University, isn't he?</i>

08:09.360 --> 08:12.380
<i>Yes.</i>
<i>And he's a very kind, nice man.</i>

08:13.660 --> 08:14.890
<i>But that's all he is.</i>

08:16.360 --> 08:18.390
<i>I want to become immortal like you.</i>

08:19.200 --> 08:21.030
<i>I want to go with you.</i>

08:24.640 --> 08:26.230
Have you forgotten, Sokichi?

08:26.710 --> 08:29.800
You came to see me off then.

08:31.080 --> 08:32.880
<i>Thanks for everything, Sokichi.</i>

08:33.580 --> 08:36.180
<i>Yuta.</i>
<i>Are you leaving Miss Nae?</i>

08:37.750 --> 08:40.220
<i>She said she was waiting for you</i>
<i>at the Red Valley.</i>

08:41.460 --> 08:42.750
<i>I can't take her with me.</i>

08:43.390 --> 08:44.290
<i>You understand?</i>

08:51.470 --> 08:52.990
A few years later...

08:53.740 --> 08:55.700
I was passing the area and...

08:56.270 --> 08:59.570
heard that she'd died.

09:02.680 --> 09:04.580
But what if...

09:05.980 --> 09:08.420
she's still alive?

09:10.550 --> 09:12.880
On the same day
you left the village...

09:13.860 --> 09:16.090
Miss Nae also disappeared.

09:16.760 --> 09:18.590
Vanished without a trace.

09:19.190 --> 09:20.160
What?

09:20.330 --> 09:22.660
It caused a huge commotion
in the village.

09:23.130 --> 09:26.030
Everyone thought Miss Nae
and you had eloped.

09:26.700 --> 09:27.430
But...

09:28.440 --> 09:31.300
<i>Nae is not a tramp.</i>

09:31.940 --> 09:35.470
<i>She'd never run away</i>
<i>with a drifter!</i>

09:36.410 --> 09:39.210
Everyone in the village
searched high and low for her...

09:39.210 --> 09:41.480
but she wasn't found, and
they came to the conclusion that...

09:41.480 --> 09:43.970
she'd been spirited away.

09:44.950 --> 09:48.180
And a funeral was performed
without her body.

09:49.320 --> 09:52.690
But Miss Nae is still alive...

09:52.690 --> 09:55.750
unchanged for 60 years!

10:04.950 --> 10:14.960
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest

10:31.600 --> 10:32.530
Miss!

10:33.200 --> 10:34.430
Where are you going?

10:35.000 --> 10:36.990
Please, go back to your room.

10:49.950 --> 10:51.040
What?

10:51.450 --> 10:53.120
Who is that filthy girl?

10:53.120 --> 10:53.880
What?

10:53.990 --> 10:54.680
Sir, she's...

10:54.820 --> 10:56.690
What kind of remark is that?

10:56.790 --> 10:58.280
I assure you that
we got rid of her...

10:58.590 --> 11:01.860
Your men killed and buried me!
And you call me filthy?

11:03.160 --> 11:03.790
Let go!

11:04.170 --> 11:05.660
I'm going back to Yuta!

11:06.430 --> 11:08.990
What did you just say?

11:22.880 --> 11:26.410
He's come back?

11:27.960 --> 11:29.420
You know Yuta?

11:30.190 --> 11:32.660
I don't even want to remember
anything about him.

11:33.260 --> 11:35.750
If only Nae hadn't met him...

11:36.160 --> 11:39.330
she wouldn't have had to
turn into what she is now.

11:41.740 --> 11:42.570
Nae?

11:43.370 --> 11:46.030
<i>A woman named Nae.</i>

11:49.680 --> 11:52.150
What do you wish we do
about that girl?

11:52.780 --> 11:54.210
We could do
the same thing again if you...

11:54.950 --> 12:00.050
She's an immortal
who ate mermaid flesh.

12:00.460 --> 12:03.120
You must sever the head.

12:04.560 --> 12:06.320
Did you not hear me?

12:06.760 --> 12:07.490
Yes, sir.

12:08.360 --> 12:10.730
Is your name Nae?

12:12.030 --> 12:12.900
For real?

12:14.200 --> 12:15.400
I don't know.

12:16.710 --> 12:18.260
Aren't you Nae?

12:20.240 --> 12:21.470
I don't know.

12:22.510 --> 12:23.910
Hey, you little wench!

12:24.680 --> 12:27.110
Do you remember
this secret path?

12:27.720 --> 12:30.780
It still leads to the property
where Miss Nae's house used to be.

12:31.020 --> 12:32.110
Where her house used to be?

12:34.160 --> 12:36.420
The land is owned by
someone else now.

12:36.990 --> 12:38.120
And oddly enough...

12:38.390 --> 12:41.160
it's Eijiro, who used to be
Miss Nae's fiancé.

12:43.430 --> 12:46.130
He married into a family-owned
conglomerate in Tokyo...

12:46.130 --> 12:47.660
as husband of the sole heiress.

12:49.500 --> 12:52.130
And he expanded the business
during the war...

12:52.940 --> 12:56.180
and then bought
all the land around here...

12:56.180 --> 12:57.540
over the next few decades.

12:57.880 --> 12:58.570
Why?

12:59.250 --> 13:00.370
Don't know.

13:00.950 --> 13:04.440
But I'm sure it has something
to do with Miss Nae.

13:06.550 --> 13:08.610
You just have to see her first.

13:09.020 --> 13:11.510
But don't do anything stupid.

13:11.860 --> 13:14.000
The house is heavily guarded
with an alarm system and...

13:14.000 --> 13:15.660
security guards and whatnot.

13:17.770 --> 13:18.730
Let go!

13:18.730 --> 13:20.070
Just come with us!
You brat!

13:20.070 --> 13:21.670
Let go! Stop it!

13:21.670 --> 13:24.190
Let go!
If you don't be quiet,
I'll wring your neck right here!

13:24.710 --> 13:25.730
Let go!

13:26.210 --> 13:27.470
Yuta!

13:27.640 --> 13:29.440
Mana! Mana!

13:30.310 --> 13:31.470
Mana!

13:32.380 --> 13:32.870
Mana!

13:36.720 --> 13:38.310
Where are you?
Answer me!

13:38.490 --> 13:39.280
Yuta!

13:49.430 --> 13:52.800
Stop the alarm.
It'll frighten Nae!

13:58.510 --> 13:59.340
Oh no.

14:05.880 --> 14:07.440
It's happening to her again.

14:09.780 --> 14:10.810
Out of my way!

14:11.290 --> 14:12.120
You bastards!

14:15.390 --> 14:16.860
Mana!

14:40.010 --> 14:40.910
<i>Nae...</i>

14:53.830 --> 14:55.020
<i>I'll tell you...</i>

14:55.430 --> 14:56.950
<i>the story of the mermaid ash.</i>

14:58.370 --> 14:59.490
<i>Mermaid ash?</i>

15:00.500 --> 15:01.470
<i>Once upon a time...</i>

15:01.700 --> 15:04.700
<i>a traveling nun came</i>
<i>to this village.</i>

15:05.410 --> 15:08.740
<i>My ancestors treated</i>
<i>her very kindly...</i>

15:09.110 --> 15:11.600
<i>she gave them a mysterious</i>
<i>powder in return.</i>

15:12.150 --> 15:13.670
<i>And that's the mermaid ash.</i>

15:14.320 --> 15:16.650
<i>It's a medicine that</i>
<i>grows trees and grass.</i>

15:18.420 --> 15:22.010
<i>I took a little bit of that powder</i>
<i>from the storehouse and...</i>

15:22.660 --> 15:24.630
<i>scattered it in this field.</i>

15:25.590 --> 15:26.650
<i>Since then...</i>

15:27.530 --> 15:30.360
<i>the flowers in this valley</i>
<i>don't die even in winter.</i>

15:31.700 --> 15:34.400
<i>These bright red flowers are</i>
<i>in full bloom all year long.</i>

15:34.940 --> 15:37.000
<i>That's why it's called</i>
<i>the Red Valley.</i>

15:37.540 --> 15:39.200
<i>My secret place.</i>

15:39.810 --> 15:44.400
<i>Only I, Sokichi, and</i>
<i>you know about it.</i>

15:49.220 --> 15:50.280
The Red Valley...

15:54.620 --> 15:55.920
Are you awake yet?

15:57.430 --> 15:58.260
Sokichi.

15:58.730 --> 15:59.690
What are you doing?

15:59.690 --> 16:00.490
You idiot!

16:00.860 --> 16:03.300
I got caught as well,
thanks to you.

16:05.730 --> 16:07.530
Where are we?

16:07.670 --> 16:09.760
Some construction site, I reckon.

16:18.780 --> 16:19.800
Yuta.

16:20.550 --> 16:22.150
I cannot bear
for one moment...

16:22.150 --> 16:26.250
to let you and Nae stay
under the same roof.

16:26.490 --> 16:29.790
Eijiro, what are you?

16:30.990 --> 16:31.860
Eijiro?

16:32.490 --> 16:34.520
It's all your fault.

16:34.860 --> 16:38.660
For what purpose have you
come back here after all this time?

16:39.230 --> 16:41.430
You!
What have you done with Mana?

16:41.800 --> 16:43.240
What have you done to Nae?

16:43.870 --> 16:46.430
What have I done to her?

16:46.940 --> 16:48.530
Nae had...

16:51.410 --> 16:54.970
Nae had to die because of you!

16:58.790 --> 16:59.380
Die...

17:00.150 --> 17:01.140
Died?

17:05.960 --> 17:07.150
Nae...

17:08.730 --> 17:12.260
Poor...poor woman...

17:19.410 --> 17:21.400
What are we gonna do
with this brat?

17:21.540 --> 17:23.440
Cut her head off for real?

17:23.680 --> 17:26.340
That old man's a little screwed
in the head, isn't he?

17:26.780 --> 17:30.650
But in any case, it'll be a waste
to kill her right away.

17:31.290 --> 17:33.340
Yeah. Before that...

17:34.960 --> 17:35.980
What are you doing?

17:36.260 --> 17:39.590
We're going to give you
a good time before you die!

17:39.590 --> 17:41.000
I won't let you!

17:41.000 --> 17:42.660
Be quiet, you brat!

17:42.660 --> 17:43.820
Let go!

17:56.280 --> 17:58.270
Nae died?

17:59.250 --> 18:00.370
I don't get it.

18:00.580 --> 18:03.310
Then who's the Miss Nae we saw?

18:04.090 --> 18:06.690
Sokichi, did Nae tell you
about the legend of...

18:06.690 --> 18:08.850
the mermaid ash?

18:09.820 --> 18:12.760
You mean the story about people
being hospitable to a traveling nun...

18:13.090 --> 18:17.260
and receiving mermaid ash that
grows trees and grass in return?

18:17.530 --> 18:18.430
Right.

18:18.970 --> 18:20.760
But there was another tale...

18:21.100 --> 18:23.870
a secret legend behind the legend
of the mermaid ash.

18:25.140 --> 18:26.400
A secret legend?

18:27.080 --> 18:29.540
The nun once upon a time
visited the village...

18:29.540 --> 18:30.980
and stayed in one of the houses.

18:31.750 --> 18:34.370
The truth is that she was killed
by the man of the house...

18:34.750 --> 18:36.580
and he stole the mermaid ash.

18:37.390 --> 18:42.350
But some of it remained
on the nun's dead body.

18:43.490 --> 18:45.980
She came back to life
and came out of her grave.

18:47.560 --> 18:50.400
She looked the same on the outside
as when she'd been alive...

18:52.130 --> 18:55.630
but inside, she was turned
into a soulless demon...

18:56.400 --> 18:59.000
and she went around killing
one villager after another.

18:59.070 --> 19:00.060
Stop it!

19:00.610 --> 19:05.100
The kind-hearted Miss Nae
couldn't have turned into a demon.

19:07.650 --> 19:09.740
You came to save me?

19:12.520 --> 19:13.490
I...

19:14.820 --> 19:16.080
promised him.

19:16.860 --> 19:21.060
In the Red Valley,
with Yuta...

19:31.040 --> 19:32.300
I get it!

19:32.810 --> 19:34.710
I get it, Eijiro.

19:35.210 --> 19:38.440
You were after the mermaid ash.

19:39.080 --> 19:42.680
You bought all the land to look for
the mermaid ash so you can bring...

19:43.050 --> 19:45.110
the dead Miss Nae back to life.

19:48.890 --> 19:50.550
She was so beautiful.

19:52.590 --> 19:55.820
A few years after
Nae had been spirited away...

19:56.200 --> 19:59.500
I found it in the red flower field.

20:00.270 --> 20:04.440
The dead body of Nae
that was as beautiful...

20:04.440 --> 20:08.880
no, glowingly more beautiful
than when she'd been alive.

20:20.390 --> 20:23.950
<i>I know she'll lead me to Yuta.</i>

20:31.670 --> 20:35.000
<i>What happened</i>
<i>in the Red Valley, Nae?</i>

20:38.810 --> 20:41.930
<i>Take me away with you.</i>
<i>Promise me.</i>

20:43.040 --> 20:44.600
<i>I'll be waiting for you</i>
<i>in the Red Valley.</i>

20:45.450 --> 20:47.210
<i>I want to become</i>
<i>immortal like you.</i>

20:48.020 --> 20:49.680
<i>I want to go with you.</i>

20:51.320 --> 20:52.010
Master.

20:54.290 --> 20:56.190
Miss Nae and the girl
have disappeared.

20:57.360 --> 20:59.590
Find them before dawn.

20:59.760 --> 21:01.730
You must under no
circumstances harm her.

21:02.600 --> 21:03.560
And the girl?

21:04.000 --> 21:06.560
Don't bother me
with such a trivial matter.

21:06.700 --> 21:07.220
Yes, sir.

21:08.300 --> 21:10.200
<i>Mana and Nae have run away?</i>

21:11.840 --> 21:12.900
This is not good.

21:13.040 --> 21:15.980
Nae isn't used to
the outside world yet.

21:16.380 --> 21:17.710
Hey, wait!

21:19.080 --> 21:20.600
I'll leave the matter here to you.

21:21.080 --> 21:23.810
Make sure you sever
the young one's head.

21:24.790 --> 21:26.880
Otherwise,
he'll come back to life.

21:27.190 --> 21:28.990
You're going to do us in?

21:29.490 --> 21:31.080
Of course.

21:31.630 --> 21:33.620
I must protect Nae.

21:34.100 --> 21:35.080
Bastard!

21:38.730 --> 21:39.560
Yuta!

21:43.370 --> 21:46.600
<i>Nae, please be safe.</i>

22:25.030 --> 22:33.540
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

22:34.910 --> 22:43.420
ltsumade kakaruno to anata wa warau kedo
"How long does it take?" You smiled at me

22:44.880 --> 22:53.760
Dorekurai oboete iru hidoku naki nagara
How much do you remember? I cried hard

22:54.810 --> 23:04.340
Dorekurai oboete iru anokoto to ieba
How much do you remember if I talk about "that thing"?

23:09.410 --> 23:18.410
ltsumademo mada utsumuite
I still look down

23:19.370 --> 23:27.880
Tobikoe rarenai mizutamari
I can't jump over the puddle

23:29.010 --> 23:38.520
Wakaranakunaru moshikasuruto
I'm confused

23:38.850 --> 23:48.360
Kawarenai no wa watashi dake kana
Maybe I'm the only one who still can't change

23:53.320 --> 24:02.880
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

24:06.310 --> 24:08.580
Nae, Mana, run!

24:09.150 --> 24:10.950
Eijiro's men are
closing in on you!

24:11.990 --> 24:15.180
What happened in
the Red Valley that day?

24:16.490 --> 24:18.690
Who buried Nae
in the flower field?

24:19.760 --> 24:22.520
Sokichi, we're going to
the Red Valley!

24:23.030 --> 24:25.430
We're going to reveal
the sealed truth of the past...

24:25.430 --> 24:27.370
in the valley of promise.

24:28.800 --> 24:30.570
Next, Episode 11,
"Promised Tomorrow, Part II".

24:30.570 --> 24:33.510
Episode 11
Promised Tomorrow
(Part II)
Next, Episode 11,
"Promised Tomorrow, Part II".

24:33.510 --> 24:34.940
Next Episode
Episode 11
Promised Tomorrow
